{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10015_01_k",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6c352bfc21e534421702afbb63c82c161ba41174e8536a1d699ae28a656ccba4",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_k:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3dbdfa3d7348ef05ac47bb69195b8f93fc29cff11817f8004dbd9790d9931974",
      "text": "握手会结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_k:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:218745d9391e843f706f3fde6bafcb804519a32cf5b387c719d29282c01d4e7e",
      "text": "各位辛苦了！\n握手会感觉如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_k:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3c8becfd728a171f813bd290b892b650ea10ea36f0a332facbc036882ad08f4",
      "text": "很开心哦。能直接从粉丝那里听到感想，\n真的很让人高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_k:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d33f0c95078bca5ae4b72814336a7345027624abf09eae541b282a6c8aecabf3",
      "text": "我也是。\n和大家聊了好多话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_k:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:921a1da5ef520a4e713f1f9ec32b0b361c5b3e20dad5524e796e5d17524f5c54",
      "text": "也有人说是因为这次的广告才认识我们的。\n这让我觉得要更加努力才行，获得了前进的力量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_k:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04cbc366ae6166db1baa86e28f730f1df0264731c3dd0fccbbe923b22143c102",
      "text": "真的很感激大家呢。各位粉丝，\n就是我们偶像力量的源泉啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_k:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d0d656526ba85b33926612642ea73a294fc5586e88e2f47f0d1521d64909ea1",
      "text": "是啊。为了那些支持我们的人，\n不得不拼尽全力了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_k:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:994bffee07de62cbdf2047b7506f94dd3564b24925977f3d98c5ca9ec0491d00",
      "text": "改天我们再为这次的工作办个庆功宴吧！\n带上我们宣传的饮料和好吃的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_k:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1af538e2ece8202a0bb27b36a7f5333fa23d4faffd2c8a923ab8d99f4a6c9cf4",
      "text": "哇啊，好棒！\n我，想聊好多今天的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10015_01:1_3_10015_01_k:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bdcda7670a975f02542cadd36280b18bf54159bba3110e700d0e65b552de52c7",
      "text": "好啊。好好聊聊吧。\n●●●●プロデューサー，也会来的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
